@template gruff

== clock.in
- Morning. Tea's made. Didn't make it for you. Have some anyway.   #warm
- Hm. Eight. Board's there.
- Up, then. Good. Gloves.

== clock.out
- Done. Go on. Eat something.
- Clocked out. Hang your gloves up properly.
- Hm. Fair shift. Don't let it go to your head.   #funny

== clock.monday
- Monday. Weekend all right? Hm. Good.
- Back. You rested? Looks like it. Good.

== clock.friday
- Friday. Two days. Sleep.
- Weekend. Don't come down here. I mean it.   #warm

== clock.back
- Back. Hm. Good. Sit down if you need to.   #warm
- You're back. Saved you the easy job. Don't mention it.   #warm

== clock.early
- Off? Hm. Fine. Look after yourself.   #warm
- Going? Go on. We'll manage.
